{{Quote|Flying's no fun if everybody can do it.|Jetray while being pursued by [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]].<ref>''[[The Secret of Chromastone]]''</ref>}}
'''Jetray''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Aerophibian (Classic)|Aerophibian]]<ref>[[P'Andor]]</ref><ref name="THtH">''[[Too Hot to Handle]]''</ref> from the planet [[Aeropela]].{{Refn|[[:File:Jetray Bandai Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name = Bandai}}

==Appearance==
Jetray is a red, humanoid [[Wikipedia:Manta ray|manta ray]]-like alien with green eyes, black outlines on his face, yellow horns extending from his nose, gills underneath his arms, yellow patagia which he uses to fly and glide through water, and two black lightning bolt-like stripes coming down from his shoulders to the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

In ''[[Video Games (Episode)|Video Games]]'', Jetray wore a blue motion capture suit.

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', the black stripes on Jetray's body are straight rather than lightning-bolted.

